# The image is built with the repository root as its context (docker/README.md). The build
# reads only the Rust workspace, the script that extracts the web IDE's files and docker/;
# everything else stays out of the context, build output and local environments above all.
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!rust-toolchain.toml
!crates/
!scripts/extract-web-root.sh
!docker/
**/target/
**/.venv/
**/__pycache__/
